<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: 1996 quarter includes one-time pretax charge of $16.6 million, or $0.10 a share, mandated by SAIF. The charge applies to about $2.7 billion of thirft deposits acquired by Fifth Third over the years. In exchange for the charge this quarter, ongoing deposit insurance premiums will be reduced by about $6.1 million annually.</p>
<p>For 1996 quarter, fully diluted net income per share excluding the assessment was $0.84.  </p>
